{
  "comment": "otel-probe.py inputs. Component directories are copied whole at their tree paths; header_trees contribute only *.h files. Source file lists live in the BUILD.bazel files and are checked against Make SRCS (srcs_var; default_src when bsd.progs.mk falls back to <prog>.c). Private INTERNALLIB directories are passed to consumers through private_libraries. source_trees are copied whole (the protobuf stack that generates and links libotelexport's OTLP bindings); a component without artifacts is a Make reference only (libupb: consumers link its _pie archive from a private object directory; protobuf-probe.py compares it with Bazel).",
